      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Green, please.",
      "translation" : "請染成綠色。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Blue, please.",
      "translation" : "請染成藍色。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "White, please.",
      "translation" : "請染成白色。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Black, please.",
      "translation" : "請染成黑色。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Actually, I like my hair as it is.",
      "translation" : "其實我覺得現在的髮色就很好。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hairdresser Jovovich]",
      "translation" : "[理髮師約沃維奇]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You must like your hair color~",
      "translation" : "看來你很喜歡自己的髮色~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hairdresser Jovovich]",
      "translation" : "[理髮師約沃維奇]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Eehh~? You're not going to dye your hair? I'm a little sad...",
      "translation" : "咦~？你不打算染髮嗎？我有點難過..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hairdresser Jovovich]",
      "translation" : "[理髮師約沃維奇]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Eh? But that's the hair color you already have. Please choose a different color.",
      "translation" : "咦？這就是你現在的髮色呀。請選個別的顏色。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hairdresser Jovovich]",
      "translation" : "[理髮師約沃維奇]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The fee is 1000 zeny. Do you not have enough...?",
      "translation" : "費用是1000金幣。你錢不夠嗎...？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hairdresser Jovovich]",
      "translation" : "[理髮師約沃維奇]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "When you're feeling down , when you get dumped, when you want to impress someone, or even when you just want to stand out...",
      "translation" : "心情低落時、被甩時、想給某人留下好印象時，甚至只是想引人注目時..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hairdresser Jovovich]",
      "translation" : "[理髮師約沃維奇]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "For that special place and time, wouldn't you want a hairstyle of your very own? As long as you have the appropriate dyestuffs, I will make your hair look wonderful.",
      "translation" : "在那個特別的地點和時刻，難道不想擁有專屬於自己的髮型嗎？只要帶來合適的染料，我就能讓你的頭髮煥然一新。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hairdresser Jovovich]",
      "translation" : "[理髮師約沃維奇]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "And try not to worry too much about the fee. Acquiring beauty is the same as acquiring everything. Hehe~",
      "translation" : "費用的事也不用太擔心。獲得美麗和得到其他東西是一樣的。嘿嘿~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hairdresser Jovovich]",
      "translation" : "[理髮師約沃維奇]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "* Fees and Information *",
      "translation" : "* 費用與說明 *"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "- 1 Dyestuffs item of the color of hair you want.",
      "translation" : "- 1份與你想染的髮色相符的染料。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "- 1000 zeny fee.",
      "translation" : "- 費用1000金幣。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hairdresser Jovovich]",
      "translation" : "[理髮師約沃維奇]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Men or Women...",
      "translation" : "男人也好，女人也好..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Everyone has the right and obligation to be beautiful.",
      "translation" : "每個人都有追求美麗的權利，也有讓自己變美的義務。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Jovovich",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Hairdresser Jovovich]",
      "translation" : "[理髮師約沃維奇]"
    },
    {
